   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Previously, after Marina scolded her son for breaking the toy tank, she stepped away to answer her ringing phone. Now, alone in the room with Lyosha, Arkady warmly thanks the boy for not betraying him, just before Marina returns with big news about Lyosha's medical surgery.",
