   "t": "Мужчина! Настоящий мужчина!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'A man! A real man!' Arkady praises the boy for showing adult loyalty and courage.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Спасибо, что не сдал меня.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Thanks for not ratting me out.' The colloquial verb means to betray or turn someone in.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Лёха, я тебе обязательно куплю танк.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Lyokha, I will definitely buy you a tank.' The future tense makes a firm promise.",
